Model Control
18. Parameters
Prompt = what to do
Parameters = how to generate
19. Temperature
Controls randomness.
Low → predictable
High → creative
20. Top-p
Controls the probability pool.
Low → focused
High → diverse
21. Max Tokens / Stop
Max tokens → maximum length
Stop sequence → when to stop
22. Penalties
Frequency → reduce repetition.
Presence → encourage new ideas.
23. Prompt + Parameters
Precise task → clear prompt + low randomness.
Creative task → creative prompt + higher randomness.
